upt dialog box for*			system disk 5.0.3.  Fixed a bug where the carry was not set*			if the user selected cancel from an Init Manager dialog.* 06/20/90 GAB		Since the JSR to the unclaimed interrupt dialog box was*			removed in the last change, I went ahead and removed the*			preceeding code which checked to see if the number of*			unclaimed interrupts had been exceeded.  Also fixed a couple*			of minor problems that were put in with the new code that*			saves the carry bit after a system call.  Since the new*			section of code is shorter than the original version, I*			added a DS.B statement which automatically makes it the same*			length to keep all of the following code in place.  Changes*			marked by {GAB}.* 09/25/90 CAF		Uncommented all the console speedup routines, now character*			output is about 28% faster, but could use some more work*			particularly in the find_fcr area.  Optimized some code*			in os_shutdown to free up more space, as marked by {CAF}.********************************************************************************